
flowchart TD
    A[Attendee] --> B[FastAPI]
    B --> C[Validate Session and Event Context]
    C --> S{Security Validation}
    S -->|Invalid Event or Cross-Event Request| X[Reject Request]
    S -->|Valid Request| D{Request Type}

    D -->|Booking| E[Mock Booking API]
    D -->|Knowledge Question| F[Hybrid RAG Retriever]
    D -->|VIP or Dissatisfaction| G[Escalation Service]

    F --> H[Generate Query Embedding]
    H --> I[(ChromaDB Vector Search)]
    F --> J[Event-Specific BM25 Index]
    
    I --> K[Reciprocal Rank Fusion]
    J --> K

    K --> L[Similarity Threshold and Lexical Match Filtering]
    L --> M{Relevant Context?}

    M -->|Yes| N[Optional Ollama Qwen LLM]
    M -->|No| O[Safe Extractive Fallback]

    E --> P[Response Assembly]
    G --> P
    N --> P
    O --> P
    X --> P

    P --> Q[Attendee Response]
    B --> R[JSONL Conversation Logging]

    T[Event Knowledge JSON] --> U[Ingestion Pipeline]
    U --> V[Sentence Transformers]
    V --> I
    U --> W[Dynamic Event-Specific BM25 Indexing]
    W --> J
